## 5. Fitur-Fitur Terbaru (Latest — April 2026)

### 🆕 A. Server-Side Anti-Spoofing (Multi-Frame Temporal Analysis)

Sistem anti-spoofing baru di server menganalisis **perubahan antar 3+ frame** yang diambil ~200ms interval:

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A["📸 3 Frame<br/>200ms interval"] --> B["MTCNN Crop<br/>per frame"]
    B --> C["Analysis 1:<br/>Micro-Motion"]
    B --> D["Analysis 2:<br/>Screen Flicker"]
    B --> E["Analysis 3:<br/>Texture Consistency"]
    C --> F["Weighted Score<br/>50% + 25% + 25%"]
    D --> F
    E --> F
    F --> G{"> 0.55?"}
    G -->|Yes| H["✅ REAL"]
    G -->|No| I["❌ SPOOF"]
```

| Analisis | Deteksi | Bobot |
|---|---|---|
| **Micro-Motion** | Foto cetak = zero motion, wajah asli = tremor otot | **50%** |
| **Screen Flicker** | Layar 60Hz → brightness oscillation periodik | **25%** |
| **Texture Consistency** | Foto = identik antar frame, wajah 3D = berubah | **25%** |

**File**: [anti_spoofing_utils.py](file:///d:/Project%20Diskominfo/project2/Face_Recognition_AI_Secure/api/anti_spoofing_utils.py) (391 lines)

### 🆕 B. Approval Workflow (Pending → Approved/Rejected)

Registrasi dari **mobile kiosk** otomatis berstatus `pending`, membutuhkan persetujuan admin:

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: Register via Mobile Kiosk
    [*] --> Approved: Register via Web Dashboard
    Pending --> Approved: Admin Approve
    Pending --> Rejected: Admin Reject
    Approved --> [*]: Bisa scan presensi
    Rejected --> [*]: Tidak bisa scan
```

- Predict endpoint sekarang **mengecek approval_status** sebelum memproses presensi
- Status disinkronkan di **kedua tabel** (`users` + `user_akses_opd`)

### 🆕 C. Mobile Kiosk Registration (Device SN Auth)

Endpoint baru `/api/register/mobile` memungkinkan registrasi langsung dari kiosk **tanpa JWT**:

| Aspek | Web Register | Mobile Register |
|---|---|---|
| Auth | JWT Token | Device SN verification |
| Initial Status | `approved` | `pending` |
| Endpoint | `/api/register` | `/api/register/mobile` |
| Perlu Approval | ❌ | ✅ |

