## 9. Analisis Performa & Skalabilitas

| Area | Issue | Solusi |
|---|---|---|
| **Linear Scan Embedding** | Loop semua folder di `samples_embedding/` | Gunakan **FAISS** / **Annoy** → O(log n) |
| **File-based Storage** | Embedding sebagai .pkl per-orang | Migrasi ke vector database |
| **Model Loading** | MTCNN + FaceNet dimuat saat startup | ✅ Sudah baik |
| 🆕 **Table Partitioning** | Presensi di-partition per bulan | ✅ Sudah diterapkan |
| **Report Query** | Virtual ABSENT records di-generate in-memory | Akan lambat jika >1000 ASN × 93 hari |
| **Dual Face Detection** | Client (ML Kit) crop → Server (MTCNN) crop | Redundan tapi konsisten |

